                                "sense_id": "c40b66cd-7395-3f68-a50e-1e74e5cda3b9",
                                "text": "Our common Pepperwort sends forth somewhat long and broad leaves, of a light bluish-green colour, finely dented about the edges and pointed at the ends […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
